---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HowToPlaySection from '../components/HowToPlaySection.astro';
import '../styles/game.css';
---

<Layout
  title="How to Play Woody Sort Game - Color Sort Puzzle Rules & Solution Strategy"
  description="Comprehensive visual tutorial and strategy guide for Woody Sort Game. Learn step-by-step algorithms, tube space management, and how to solve color sort problems easily."
>
  <div class="guide-page-wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="guide-header text-center">
        <span class="wood-badge">📖 Complete Strategy Guide</span>
        <h1 class="guide-title">How to Master Woody Sort Game</h1>
        <p class="guide-subtitle">
          Master the art of color separation with proven tips, step-by-step sorting rules, and advanced deadlock prevention.
        </p>
      </div>

      <HowToPlaySection />

      <!-- Deep Dive Algorithm & Solving Breakdown -->
      <section class="deep-dive-section">
        <div class="woody-card deep-card">
          <h2 class="sub-heading">Step-by-Step Color Sort Solving Algorithm</h2>
          <div class="steps-flow">
            <div class="step-box">
              <div class="step-num">Step 1</div>
              <h4>Survey the Tubes</h4>
              <p>Scan all tubes for colors that are nearly completed (e.g. 2 or 3 matching balls already together at the bottom). Prioritize consolidating those colors first.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step-box">
              <div class="step-num">Step 2</div>
              <h4>Create Your First Empty Buffer</h4>
              <p>Focus all early transfers on emptying out a single tube completely. Once you have an empty buffer, your maneuvering flexibility expands dramatically.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step-box">
              <div class="step-num">Step 3</div>
              <h4>Unbury Lower Hidden Balls</h4>
              <p>Whenever you have the choice between two valid moves, choose the move that exposes a new, buried color at the bottom of a source tube.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step-box">
              <div class="step-num">Step 4</div>
              <h4>Seal Completed Tubes</h4>
              <p>When a tube reaches 4 identical balls, it is locked. Treat it as completed and do not disturb it, narrowing down the remaining puzzle size.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-box text-center">
          <h3 class="cta-title">Ready to Test Your Strategy?</h3>
          <p class="cta-text">Put these rules into practice right now on Level 1.</p>
          <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            <span>Play Woody Sort Now ➔</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .guide-page-wrapper {
    padding: 36px 0 60px;
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .guide-header {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .guide-title {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 12px 0 8px;
  }

  .guide-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .deep-dive-section {
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .deep-card {
    padding: 36px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
  }

  .sub-heading {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--wood-gold);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .steps-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .step-box {
    background: rgba(26, 18, 11, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-num {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--wood-gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .step-box h4 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .step-box p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .cta-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(61, 35, 20, 0.9) 0%, rgba(26, 18, 11, 0.9) 100%);
    border: 2px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
    padding: 36px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--wood-gold);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .cta-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .btn-lg {
    padding: 14px 32px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .steps-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
